dventure book and is an excellent choice for horror fans, avid readers, and lovers of creepy pastas. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948630/extras/63ecdf085053d8a50dcf4bc8557a950d.avif?t=1715087215\" width=616 height=112 /></span><br><br>Each playthrough lasts 45 \u2013 60 minutes and covers ~9,000 words. The entire story is approximately 31,000 words (roughly the length of Of Mice and Men by John Steinbeck).<br><br>Each playthrough will feel like a complete short story altered by the player\u2019s choices. However, multiple read-throughs will be required to uncover the entire mystery.<br><br><i>The Sleeping Sickness</i> has six possible endings. Will you experience them all? Will you solve the mystery? Will you cure the sleeping sickness?",
